    "created_at": "2022-06-03T17:55:23Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-03T17:55:23Z",
    "body": "The WPT has [been updated](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/34240) to throw a `TypeError` if a negative value is passed, but I'll leave this issue open for the discussion of what we should do when an offset is passed which is too large for the underlying OS to handle",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
