    "created_at": "2022-06-07T08:55:06Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T08:55:06Z",
    "body": "Thoughts on `NotSupportedError`, since whether the value is supported as an offset may depend on the OS? (sorry, I'm not sure whether this is consistent with how the error code is used elsewhere.) Otherwise `TypeError` seems reasonable to me  :)",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
