    "updated_at": "2022-06-07T09:24:53Z",
    "body": "Good point! I'll update Chrome's implementation to make this a `TypeError`. We probably can't write a WPT asserting this (since some OSes/browsers could support values above the max signed long long) but we should add a note in the spec (#21).",
